---
layout: base.njk
title: Matt Hovis
permalink: /
charts: true
---
{%- set months = { "01": "Jan", "02": "Feb", "03": "Mar", "04": "Apr", "05": "May", "06": "Jun", "07": "Jul", "08": "Aug", "09": "Sep", "10": "Oct", "11": "Nov", "12": "Dec" } -%}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Atlanta, GA</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Matt Hovis</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">Developer and business analyst. I build production software with AI coding agents.</p>
    <div class="hero__body">
      <p class="lede">
        I joined a B2B SaaS company in support in 2022, became a business analyst in 2023, and started writing code
        in February 2026. Since then I have merged <strong>1,192 pull requests</strong> in 16 repositories.
        AI agents write most of the code. I plan each change, review it, test it, and merge it.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="#work">Work</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <dl class="kpis">
      <div class="kpi"><dt>Pull requests merged</dt><dd>1,192</dd><p>of 1,395 opened, Feb – Nov 2026</p></div>
      <div class="kpi"><dt>Lines merged</dt><dd>660k</dd><p>+660,728 added, −103,946 removed</p></div>
      <div class="kpi"><dt>Lines of test code</dt><dd>124k</dd><p>in 1,347 test files</p></div>
      <div class="kpi"><dt>Median open to merge</dt><dd>2.6<small>h</small></dd><p>main product repository</p></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="section__num">01</p>
      <h2 id="work-h">Selected work</h2>
      <p class="section__intro">2026, on a repair and service-management platform for retail chains. Client names are left out.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="cases">
      {% for c in work %}
      <article class="case">
        <p class="case__meta"><span>{{ c.tag }}</span><span>{{ c.when }}</span></p>
        <h3 class="case__title">{{ c.title }}</h3>
        <dl class="case__body">
          <dt>Problem</dt><dd>{{ c.problem }}</dd>
          <dt>What I did</dt><dd>{{ c.did }}</dd>
          <dt>Result</dt><dd class="case__result">{{ c.result }}</dd>
        </dl>
        <ul class="chips" aria-label="Stack">{% for s in c.stack %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="code" aria-labelledby="code-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="section__num">02</p>
      <h2 id="code-h">2026 in code</h2>
      <p class="section__intro">From GitHub. My first commit was on 3 February 2026. Most of the repositories are private.</p>
    </header>

    <figure class="chart" id="heatmap-fig">
      <figcaption>
        <h3>Contributions per day</h3>
        <p>Commits, pull requests, and reviews. 3,263 in 2026, on 192 days.</p>
      </figcaption>
      <div class="chart__scroll"><div class="chart__plot" id="heatmap" role="img" aria-label="Calendar heatmap of GitHub contributions per day in 2026. Activity starts in February and peaks at 282 on 16 September."></div></div>
      <div class="heat-legend" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Less</span><i class="h0"></i><i class="h1"></i><i class="h2"></i><i class="h3"></i><i class="h4"></i><span>More</span>
      </div>
    </figure>

    <div class="chart-row">
      <figure class="chart" id="months-fig">
        <figcaption>
          <h3>Pull requests opened per month</h3>
          <p>By where the work lives.</p>
        </figcaption>
        <ul class="legend" aria-label="Legend">
          <li><i class="sw sw--1"></i>Day job</li>
          <li><i class="sw sw--2"></i>Collaborations</li>
          <li><i class="sw sw--3"></i>Personal</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="chart__plot" id="months" role="img" aria-label="Stacked bar chart of pull requests opened per month, February to November 2026. Peak in July with 442."></div>
        <details class="table-view">
          <summary>Show as table</summary>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Month</th><th scope="col">Day job</th><th scope="col">Collaborations</th><th scope="col">Personal</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for m, v in stats.prsByMonth %}
              <tr><th scope="row">{{ months[m.slice(5)] }}</th><td>{{ v.work or 0 }}</td><td>{{ v.collab or 0 }}</td><td>{{ v.personal or 0 }}</td></tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </details>
      </figure>

      <figure class="chart" id="langs-fig">
        <figcaption>
          <h3>Lines added by language</h3>
          <p>Merged pull requests, code files only. A minimum: counts read the first 100 files of each PR.</p>
        </figcaption>
        <div class="chart__plot" id="langs" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart of lines added by language. PHP leads with about 281 thousand, then JavaScript, Swift, Vue, TypeScript, Kotlin, HTML, and CSS."></div>
        <details class="table-view">
          <summary>Show as table</summary>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Language</th><th scope="col">Lines added</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>{% for l in stats.languages %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ l[0] }}</th><td>{{ l[1] }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
          </table>
        </details>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <ul class="facts">
      <li><strong>19 days</strong> in a row with a merged PR, 29 June to 17 July</li>
      <li><strong>83 merges</strong> on the busiest day, 17 September</li>
      <li><strong>417 tickets</strong> named in pull request titles on the main product</li>
      <li><strong>3,582 commits</strong> across 11,821 changed files</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="stats-data">{{ stats | dump | safe }}</script>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="section__num">03</p>
      <h2 id="projects-h">Side projects</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="projects">
      {% for p in projects %}
      <article class="project{% if p.featured %} project--featured{% endif %}">
        <p class="project__kind">{{ p.kind }}</p>
        <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.blurb }}</p>
        <ul class="chips" aria-label="Stack">{% for s in p.stack %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        {% if p.links.length %}
        <p class="project__links">{% for l in p.links %}<a href="{{ l.href }}"{% if l.href.startsWith('http') %} rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ l.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endfor %}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="career" aria-labelledby="career-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="section__num">04</p>
      <h2 id="career-h">Career</h2>
    </header>
    <ol class="timeline">
      {% for j in career %}
      <li class="timeline__item">
        <p class="timeline__when">{{ j.when }}</p>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ j.role }}</h3>
          <p class="timeline__org">{{ j.org }}</p>
          <p>{{ j.body }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="creds">
      <h3>Certifications and study</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>SQL certificate, 2022</li>
        <li>Atlassian: Jira Service Management, Jira, and Confluence fundamentals</li>
        <li>Working toward a Bachelor of Applied Science</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div>
      <header class="section__head section__head--tight">
        <p class="section__num">05</p>
        <h2 id="about-h">Outside work</h2>
      </header>
      <ul class="interests">
        <li><strong>Video games.</strong> RPGs and retro games.</li>
        <li><strong>Comics and manga.</strong> Superhero, indie, and slice-of-life.</li>
        <li><strong>Gunpla.</strong> Model kits, built and panel-lined.</li>
        <li><strong>Baseball.</strong> Atlanta Braves.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <figure class="about__photo">
      <img src="/gunpla-sm.jpg" alt="A finished Gunpla model kit on display" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1200" />
      <figcaption>One of my Gunpla builds.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="section__num">06</p>
    <h2 id="contact-h" class="contact__title">Contact</h2>
    <p class="lede">Email is the best way to reach me.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="mailto:matt.hovis@icloud.com">matt.hovis@icloud.com</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matthewkhovis" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/mattkhovis" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
